{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01389",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 6.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, uh, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.32,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.61,
      "end_seconds": 26.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this. We came because of pain on the outside of my elbow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.7,
      "end_seconds": 37.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.57,
      "end_seconds": 52.26,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "Yes, lifting the kettle. That makes it worse. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.8,
      "end_seconds": 60.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 61.06,
      "end_seconds": 67.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.09,
      "end_seconds": 71.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.48,
      "end_seconds": 78.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any numbness, neck pain or swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.2,
      "end_seconds": 93.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "No, no numbness, no neck pain, no swelling. I did have a weaker grip at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.04,
      "end_seconds": 98.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.21,
      "end_seconds": 102.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.06,
      "end_seconds": 107.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.14,
      "end_seconds": 111.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Furosemide, 40 milligrams, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.1,
      "end_seconds": 117.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.89,
      "end_seconds": 127.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it it next time. It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 129.92,
      "end_seconds": 141.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.6,
      "text": "oh, doctor, I think the last prescription for the alendronate was 35 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.34,
      "end_seconds": 148.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.08,
      "end_seconds": 165.23,
      "duration_seconds": 16.15,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it it next time. I'm on ibuprofen gel, three times a day. I, I was on carvedilol before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.08,
      "end_seconds": 170.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.86,
      "end_seconds": 180.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Heart failure, for about ten years i have thin bones, for five years yes, an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.82,
      "end_seconds": 187.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Okay, I can see heart failure in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.87,
      "end_seconds": 199.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.98,
      "end_seconds": 212.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.82,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.4,
      "end_seconds": 231.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.48,
      "end_seconds": 240.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.23,
      "end_seconds": 242.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.5,
      "end_seconds": 246.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.35,
      "end_seconds": 250.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.4,
      "end_seconds": 255.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.88,
      "end_seconds": 259.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.57,
      "end_seconds": 273.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.18,
      "end_seconds": 308.75,
      "duration_seconds": 13.57,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 113 over 71, pulse 69, weight 68 kilos, height 182 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temp 36.7 degrees, BMI works out to 20.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.11,
      "end_seconds": 315.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I'll need to to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.26,
      "end_seconds": 319.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.75,
      "end_seconds": 343.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "It's tender over the bony point on the outside, and it hurts when I resist your wrist going up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.46,
      "end_seconds": 354.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "so, thank you, you can get dressed taking everything into account, my working impression is tennis elbow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.38,
      "end_seconds": 361.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Mm, you know, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.8,
      "end_seconds": 400.64,
      "duration_seconds": 34.84,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's tennis elbow, and we'll watch how it goes. Rest it, use a forearm strap and do the stretches I'll show you. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like you back if it is not better in six weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 405.66,
      "end_seconds": 410.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.38,
      "end_seconds": 415.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.08,
      "end_seconds": 420.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.38,
      "end_seconds": 423.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
}